{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>賽孚迅國際配股集資近2.1億元。</p><p></p><p>每股配售價0.973元，較上日收市價折讓逾一成八，配售最多2.15億股新股，佔已擴大發行股本逾一成四，集資所得擬用於新能源電站，建造承包的項目營運資金、東南亞及非洲業務拓展等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T01:23:11.987935+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T02:18:00.970061+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:18:01.188655+00:00","content_hash":"ec601e5af07a8d1eed2bbd12d1a88d9fffbe83ae8a238949d166bb3e5495f744","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}